  },
  "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-08.html",
   "quest": 622,
   "text": "Jeremy: What are you still doing here? Have you forgotten what you were supposed to do? Go to Warehouse Keeper Lietta in the Town of Goddard and say that you've come on my orders.",
   "header": "Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7; lacks items 7197"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-01.htm",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Long ago, the most distinguished aristocrats of the empire came here for their excursions. Those bastards! When I refused to be their personal chef, they insulted my food! They have no appreciation for haute cuisine! As hard as they tried, no one could find fault with my food! Those cr…",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; (talker.getLevel() >= MIN_LVL)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I'll help you.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00623_TheFinestFood 31521-03.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00623_TheFinestFood",
     "event": "31521-03.htm",
     "quest": 623,
     "to": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-03.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-02.htm",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Thanks anyway, but you're definitely not up to it. (Only a character of level 71 or above may undertake this quest.)",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT (talker.getLevel() >= MIN_LVL)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-04.html",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: No, no, no! I can't do it unless you bring me the exact amount of ingredients! What did I do to deserve this?",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-05.html",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Excellent! I didn't think you'd survive! Oh, did I say that out loud? I meant to say, I'm very happy to see you back so soon! Now, let's have a look at those ingredients.",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Here you go.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00623_TheFinestFood 31521-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00623_TheFinestFood",
     "event": "31521-06.html",
     "quest": 623,
     "to": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-06.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-06.html",
      "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-07.html"
     ],
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-01.htm",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: This is terrible. Terrible! That promising young chef Donath will be in the cooking competition, and unless I make something truly special I fear he will walk away with the top honors. But what to make, what to make? There IS one dish, but the ingredients are so difficult to get that I…",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LVL)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say that you will help.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1 31521-02.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1",
     "event": "31521-02.htm",
     "quest": 624,
     "to": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-02.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-00.htm": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-00.htm",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: I need someone to find some ingredients for me. I don't intend to feed the monsters! (Only a character of level 73 or above may undertake this quest.)",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT (player.getLevel() >= MIN_LVL)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-03.html",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: What the...?! Blast! Do you want to see a chef go crazy? While you're wasting time, Donath is probably creating a dish that will steal away my position as top chef! Leave now, gather the ingredients and bring them to me at once! There's no time to waste!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-04.html",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Unbelievable! You brought them back so quickly! I had a good feeling about you! This should be plenty for now. Now, let me have those ingredients.",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Here you go.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1 31521-05.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1",
