  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-01.htm",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: It's ready. Now give me the soy sauce that I gave you earlier.",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; level >= 73; (hasItem(talker, SOY_SOURCE_JAR))"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Here's your Pot of Soy Sauce.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2 31521-04.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2",
     "event": "31521-04.htm",
     "quest": 625,
     "to": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-04.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-02.htm",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: What happened to the pot of soy sauce I gave you? I need it to flavor the food I'm making to lure that creature out!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; level >= 73; NOT (hasItem(talker, SOY_SOURCE_JAR))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-03.htm",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Hey! I know my food is wonderful, but if you eat too much of it and get fat, how will you carry out such a dangerous assignment? (Only a character of level 73 or above may undertake this quest.)",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT level >= 73"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-05.html",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Once I get that yeti's meat, I'll put that arrogant Donath in his place! Stop fooling around! Take the food I gave you and lure Bumbalump out. Understand?",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-06.html",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Where's the Special Yeti Meat? I don't want anything else! As I said, all I need is the special meat from Bumbalump! Get it?!!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-07.html",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: So, you slaughtered him? Did you bring the meat?",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 3"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Here's your meat.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2 31521-08.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2",
     "event": "31521-08.html",
     "quest": 625,
     "to": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-08.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-08.html",
      "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-09.html"
     ],
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00037_MakeFormalWear/31521-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00037_MakeFormalWear/31521-02.html",
   "quest": 37,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: I just got an order for a cool bottle of wine from Information Broker Mist at the Hot Springs Resort. If you'll take it to him, I'll bake some cookies for you. Is that a deal or what? Hurry! I'll have some fresh, hot cookies waiting for you!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "3"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00037_MakeFormalWear/31521-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00037_MakeFormalWear/31521-05.html",
   "quest": 37,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: What a relief! Very well, as promised, here are your cookies. I sealed the box very tight to keep them fresh. Handle it carefully so that you don't break them, and give my regards to Leikar!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "5"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00621_EggDelivery/31521-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00621_EggDelivery/31521-03.htm",
   "quest": 621,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Take these hard-Boiled Eggs to my customers at the hot springs resort. Everyone likes their eggs done a different way.You must deliver them in the order! Look at the note I gave you for details, and don't ever forget our motto, \"The Customer Always Comes First\"!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00621_EggDelivery/31521-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00621_EggDelivery/31521-06.html",
   "quest": 621,
   "text": "Jeremy: Excellent! You seem to have more aptitude for delivery work than I thought. You did a good job, but unfortunately, I don't have the Adena to pay you. I don't have any more work for you, either... Talk to Valentine in the Town of Goddard. He owes me, and he'll give you a satisfactory reward.",
   "header": "Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "7"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00621_EggDelivery/31521-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00621_EggDelivery/31521-07.html",
   "quest": 621,
   "text": "Jeremy: Hey, hey. You didn't just deliver that food without getting paid, right? Do make me sweat over small stuff like this. I'm leaving the small stuff up to you!",
   "header": "Jeremy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-03.htm",
   "quest": 622,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Please take this specialty liquor to my customers at the hot springs resort. Our motto is \"The Customer Always Comes First!\" Don't ever forget it!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-06.html",
   "quest": 622,
   "text": "Jeremy: My mother's mother's mother made this wine for the soldiers fighting in the war. They say that when the soldiers drank it, it so raised their fighting spirit that they won the battle. Believe it or not! In any case, I'd like to pay you for your work, but I'm afraid that I don't have any mon…",
   "header": "Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "7"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00622_SpecialtyLiquorDelivery/31521-07.html",
   "quest": 622,
   "text": "Jeremy: Deliver and collect the money, deliver and collect the money. You just have to keep repeating. Go finish the rest of your deliveries and get back here.",
   "header": "Jeremy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-03.htm",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Wonderful! I need some Leaves of Hot Springs Flava , Meat of Hot Springs Buffalo and Horn of Hot Springs Antelope . Please bring me one hundred of each. I know it's a lot, but what can I say? Do it for the advancement of culinary science!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-06.html",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Fantastic! You obviously know talent when you see it! This is my current menu. It changes frequently, since my customers are constantly dropping off delicious new ingredients!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00623_TheFinestFood/31521-07.html",
   "quest": 623,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: This amount of materials is not enough!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-02.htm",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: The dish I shall make for the competition is called \"Smoked Yeti.\" However, I cannot make it with ordinary Yeti meat; I need the meat from the Icicle Emperor, the greatest of all the Yeti. The Icicle Emperor ventures out only rarely, however, so we must first cook another meal as bait.…",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-05.html",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Keep this soy sauce with you, and come back when you have the rest of the ingredients. Hold on a second... Ah yes, here are some Ice Crystals . They'll keep the sauce fresh, and you can use them for something else later on...",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00624_TheFinestIngredientsPart1/31521-06.html",
   "quest": 624,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Are you kidding me? You had the ingredients and now they're gone? I need to sit down!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-04.htm",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: All right, now find the Icicle Emperor Bumbalump, or whatever you want to call him, and put out this food and wait. He loves to eat, and won't be able to resist such a scrumptious meal from a world-class chef! You must hurry! Kill that filthy creature and bring me his meat! One more th…",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-08.html",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Here is your pay. Many people were impressed by the dish I made. Whenever you have a chance, please stop by and help me again.",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00625_TheFinestIngredientsPart2/31521-09.html",
   "quest": 625,
   "text": "Chef Jeremy: Where are my ingredients? Unless you bring them to me at once, I won't have enough time to create a new dish!",
   "header": "Chef Jeremy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
